    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing sources",
     "texto": [
      "Notice who speaks, to whom and what they want to achieve. A news item usually summarises facts and statements; an opinion letter defends a position."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contrasting reasons",
     "texto": [
      "**på den ene side … på den anden side** presents two sides; **derimod** and **til gengæld** contrast elements. Sharing a topic doesn't imply agreement."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
